"""
  |OMC_BTS:
  | ------------------------------------------------------------
  |  rtpm_activate -- Activates Real Time PM reporting on NE
  | ------------------------------------------------------------
  |  Usage: rtpm_activate -type <TYPE> -period <PERIOD> -port <PORT>
  |
  |  -type <TYPE>
  |         all : (default) all PM counters are reported,
  |         pdcp: only PDCP_SDU_Group PM counters subset is reported
  |
  |  -period <PERIOD>
  |         reporting period [5, 10, 30, 60] seconds (default 60). If TYPE is set to 'all' only value of 60
  |         is allowed.
  |
  |  -port <PORT>
  |         port number of trace collecting entity. The option is needed only in case when default port number
  |         should be overwritten. Default port number is calculated from following formula:
  |
  |         PORT = 30000 + OFFSET + BTS_ID
  |
  |         OFFSET depends on hardware platform:
  |
  |           macro (FSM): 9000
  |           micro (FZM): fdd=7000 tdd=6000
  |           pico  (FZP): fdd=5000 tdd=4000 fdd2=3000
"""
